---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="FAQ | Bush Gums"
  ><article class="content-page">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span><h1>
        Good questions before a first overnight.
      </h1><div class="faq">
        <details open>
          <summary>Can I buy these kits?</summary><p>
            No. The current products, prices and kits are sample data used to
            test the website concept.
          </p>
        </details><details>
          <summary>Are the temperature and R-value claims tested?</summary><p>
            No. Any ratings shown on demo products are clearly labelled
            placeholders. Future recommendations must use verified manufacturer
            specifications.
          </p>
        </details><details>
          <summary>Does the kit include everything I need?</summary><p>
            It covers a sample core gear setup. Clothing, navigation, food,
            water, first aid, communications and trip-specific safety gear still
            need separate planning.
          </p>
        </details><details>
          <summary>Is the builder personalised safety advice?</summary><p>
            No. It is a simple rules-based demonstration. Always match your
            equipment and experience to the actual route, forecast and park
            advice.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article></BaseLayout
>
